="page-header__blog-post-details__bullet">•</span> 7 July 2023 <span class="page-header__blog-post-details__bullet">•</span><a>User blog:Marphimon</a></div></div></div><div class="page-header__actions" id="p-views"><a class="wds-button wds-is-text page-header__action-button" data-tracking-label="comments-button" aria-label="Comments"><div id="article-comments-button" class="button-counter">5</div><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-small" /></a><a class="wds-button wds-is-text page-header__action-button page-header__collections has-label" id="collections-save-button" data-tracking-label="save-to-collection" aria-label="Sign In to Save" title="Sign In to Save"><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-small" /><span class="page-header__collections-text-short">Save</span></a></div></div></div><div id="content" class="page-content ve-init-mw-desktopArticleTarget-targetContainer"><!-- -2 wrappers  class="mw-body-content mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output"--><p>We are happy to have you join our Fandom community and are looking into getting started! </p><figure class="thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon"><a class="mw-file-description image"><img alt="Let's get started with your fan journey!" class="thumbimage lazyloaded" data-image-name="Advice-beginner-your first steps.png" data-image-key="Advice-beginner-your_first_steps.png" data-relevant="0" data-src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/5/5c/Advice-beginner-your_first_steps.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20231002201214"><div><!-- -2 wrappers  class="gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div></a><figcaption class="thumbcaption"><p class="caption">Let's get started with your fan journey!</p></figcaption></figure><p>In this very simple tutorial, you will learn the essentials of how to<b> sign up and set up your account on Fandom</b><!-- -2 siblings -->, how to get started with - both the web pages containing fan documentation, and how to get started with . After reading up on these simple basics, you will be able to explore and join your favorite fandom wikis to connect with other people sharing the same passion! </p><h2><span id="How_do_I_sign_up_for_a_Fandom_user_account.3F"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="How_do_I_sign_up_for_a_Fandom_user_account?">How do I sign up for a Fandom user account?</span><span class="mw-editsection"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="mw-editsection-visualeditor" title="Sign in to edit" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-action="edit-section" data-testid="log-in-edit-section" aria-label="Sign in to edit"--><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-tiny" /></span></h2><p>If you have not already signed up, this is how you do it: </p><div id="gallery-0" data-seq-no="0" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -2 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox" id="Simple-sign-up-mobile-png" title="Simple-sign-up-mobile.png (11 KB)"--><img title="Simple-sign-up-mobile.png (11 KB)" class="thumbimage lazyloaded" alt="Mobile: Tap on the avatar icon in the top right of your screen and tap &quot;Register&quot;. This takes you to the registration flow." data-image-name="Simple-sign-up-mobile.png" data-image-key="Simple-sign-up-mobile.png" data-relevant="1" data-caption="Mobile: Tap on the avatar icon in the top right of your screen and tap &quot;Register&quot;. This takes you to the registration flow." data-src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/2/2c/Simple-sign-up-mobile.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230718082118"><div><!-- -2 wrappers  class="gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div></div><div class="lightbox-caption">Mobile: Tap on the avatar icon in the top right of your screen and tap "Register". This takes you to the registration flow.</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -2 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox" id="Simple-sign-up-desktop-png" title="Simple-sign-up-desktop.png (103 KB)"--><img title="Simple-sign-up-desktop.png (103 KB)" class="thumbimage lazyloaded" alt="Desktop: On the top right of each Fandom page, you can see an option that says &quot;Register&quot;. This takes you to the registration flow." data-image-name="Simple-sign-up-desktop.png" data-image-key="Simple-sign-up-desktop.png" data-relevant="1" data-caption="Desktop: On the top right of each Fandom page, you can see an option that says &quot;Register&quot;. This takes you to the registration flow." data-src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/2/21/Simple-sign-up-desktop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230718082111"><div><!-- -2 wrappers  class="gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div></div><div class="lightbox-caption">Desktop: On the top right of each Fandom page, you can see an option that says "Register". This takes you to the registration flow.</div></div></div><p>Direct link: <a class="external free">https://auth.fandom.com/register</a></p><p>Next, choose an option to register - you can connect using social media (Facebook, Google, Twitch, Apple) or register with an email and password. After signing up with an email, you will be asked to verify your email, so make sure to check your inbox! </p><h2><span id="How_do_I_set_up_my_viewing_experience.3F"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="How_do_I_set_up_my_viewing_experience?">How do I set up my viewing experience?</span><span class="mw-editsection"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="mw-editsection-visualeditor" title="Sign in to edit" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-action="edit-section" data-testid="log-in-edit-section" aria-label="Sign in to edit"--><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-tiny" /></span></h2><p>Congratulations on signing up and joining the Fandom community! To make sure you have the best possible viewing experience tailored to your needs, let's visit your user account settings. On Fandom, these are called "Preferences", which is what you will see in the screenshots. Keep in mind for later - settings = preferences, because it's about your <i>preferred</i> settings! </p><p>If you are looking to adjust your text size on mobile, you will need to tap "mobile options". This will bring you to the following screen. </p><p><b>Special Mobile Specific Settings</b></p><figure class="thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon"><a class="mw-file-description image"><!-- -3 wrappers  class="gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></a><figcaption class="thumbcaption"><p class="caption">Customizing your mobile specific settings</p></figcaption></figure><div></div><h3><span id="Accessing_your_account_settings_.2F_user_preferences"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="Accessing_your_account_settings_/_user_preferences">Accessing your account settings / user preferences</span><span class="mw-editsection"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="mw-editsection-visualeditor" title="Sign in to edit" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-action="edit-section" data-testid="log-in-edit-section" aria-label="Sign in to edit"--><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-tiny" /></span></h3><div id="gallery-1" data-seq-no="1" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -5 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" id="Simple-preferences-mobile-png" title="Simple-preferences-mobile.png (15 KB)" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div><div class="lightbox-caption">How to locate your user settings on mobile</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -5 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" id="Simple-preferences-desktop-png" title="Simple-preferences-desktop.png (15 KB)" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div><div class="lightbox-caption">How to locate your user settings on desktop</div></div></div><p>Now that we have accessed the settings - your "user preferences" - we'll dive into the most frequently asked questions. </p><p><b>I prefer a light/dark theme, how can I update my settings/preferences?</b></p><dl><dd>When accessing your settings, you see 6 options near the top of your screen/the white page. By default, you see "User profile" highlighted. Next to it, there is a tab called "Appearance". Click that one.</dd></dl><div id="gallery-2" data-seq-no="2" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -5 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" id="Simple-preferences-appearance-location-png" title="Simple-preferences-appearance-location.png (20 KB)" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div><div class="lightbox-caption">Location of "Appearance" tab. On smaller displays, you might have to scroll to the right to find it.</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -5 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" id="Simple-preferences-appearance-theme-png" title="Simple-preferences-appearance-theme.png (13 KB)" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div><div class="lightbox-caption">Choose the one you prefer - light or dark theme, or whichever the wiki you are visiting chose as a default!</div></div></div><dl><dd>You can also change this setting on the fly on each page if you want to check out how a wiki looks in the other theme!</dd></dl><div id="gallery-3" data-seq-no="3" class="wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium"><div class="wikia-gallery-caption"></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -5 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" id="Simple-preferences-onwiki-themechange-desktop-png" title="Simple-preferences-onwiki-themechange-desktop.png (32 KB)" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div><div class="lightbox-caption">Switch between dark and light theme on desktop.</div></div><div class="wikia-gallery-item"><div class="thumb"><!-- -5 wrappers  class="gallery-image-wrapper accent image lightbox gallery-icon-container view-image icon-container" id="Simple-preferences-onwiki-themechange-mobile-png" title="Simple-preferences-onwiki-themechange-mobile.png (19 KB)" aria-label="view image"--><svg /></div><div class="lightbox-caption">Switch between dark and light theme on mobile.</div></div></div><p><br></p><p> Congratulations on updating your preferences! Remember, that's the word Fandom uses for account settings. If you want to learn more advanced ways to customize your <a title="Help:Preferences">user preferences</a>, or <a title="Help:Profiles">how to set up your profile on Fandom</a>, click any of the links, or if you want to take the next step on your journey to become the very best, head over to learning how to get started with contributing to Fandom!</p><div class="mainpage-box text-align-center listevents-table"><span><span></span></span><br><span class="listevents-header"><a title="Help:Your First Steps on Fandom">Getting Started</a> With:</span><div><br><p><span class="mainpage-box__links"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="mw-default-size"--><span></span></span><strong class="mw-selflink selflink">Signing Up &amp; Personalizing</strong></p><p><span class="mainpage-box__links"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="mw-default-size"--><span></span></span><a title="User blog:Marphimon/Getting Started With Contributing to Wikis">Contributing to Wikis</a></p><p><span class="mainpage-box__links"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="mw-default-size"--><span></span></span><a title="User blog:LucyKuranSKYDOME/Getting Started With Joining Wiki Discussion">Discussing Fandoms</a></p></div><div class="mainpage-box__links"><span class="mw-default-size"><a title="Help:Your Next Steps on Fandom"></a></span><a title="Help:Your Next Steps on Fandom">Take the Next Steps</a></div></div></div><div class="page-footer"><div class="wds-collapsible-panel wds-is-collapsed page-footer__categories" aria-label="Toggle Categories"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="wds-collapsible-panel__header"--> Categories <svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-small" /></div><div class="wds-collapsible-panel wds-is-collapsed page-footer__languages" aria-label="Toggle Languages"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="wds-collapsible-panel__header"--> Languages <svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-small" /></div><div class="license-description"> Community content is available under <a>CC-BY-SA</a> unless otherwise noted. </div><div id="mw-data-after-content"><!-- -2 wrappers  class="ArticleAnonymousComments_anonymousCommentsSection__tQcO0" data-testid="article-comments-anonymous-section"--><div class="ArticleAnonymousComments_anonymousCommentsCounter__hgqSZ" data-testid="article-comments-anonymous-counter"><!-- -1 wrappers  class="CommentCounter_comment-counter__Kr4tO"--><p>5 Comments</p></div><div class="ArticleAnonymousComments_anonymousCommentsContent__uSoxq"><span class="ArticleAnonymousComments_anonymousCommentsHeaderIcon__Xm7fB"><svg class="wds-icon" /></span><h3 class="ArticleAno